- Validate server-side inputs.
- Use secure authentication.
- Enforce authorization.
- Limit upload types and sizes.
- Handle malicious input.
- Apply appropriate database access policies.
- Keep sensitive information private.
- Maintain audit history for important actions.

## 17.4 Preserve data

Do not delete existing records.

Do not replace the existing database with localStorage.

Do not migrate data destructively.

Use migrations and backups when appropriate.

